    {
      "displayText": "我說，這位訓練家，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳聽我說說好嗎……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118AAAFF0C90194F4D8A137DF45BB6FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3807D62118AAA8AAA597D55CE20262026001000020114013F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最近我家的公寓\n總是會發生些奇怪的事呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
